The Root Cause Analysis above names the exact existing helper to reuse (`ContentstackFactory`). Do NOT run CodeGraph or explore the codebase to re-find it — that wastes your turn budget. Import it, apply the prescribed minimal fix, write your file(s), and stop. Only search if you hit something the prescribed fix genuinely does not cover.


